  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1771441689_5969332_ae2ae5d5d0c467658ec58f431735ef79.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Lulu-Belle is dedicated to timeless elegance and curated quality. We offer a selection of sophisticated lifestyle products and accessories designed for those who appreciate aesthetic functionalism and modern style. Every piece in our collection is chosen to add a touch of grace to everyday life.</p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Unlike fast-fashion brands, Lulu-Belle focuses on a \"less is more\" philosophy. We prioritize a clean, minimalist aesthetic and high-quality materials. Our customers don't just buy a product; they invest in a lifestyle of curated beauty and lasting value.</p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">As a Lulu-Belle partner, you earn<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>an 8% commission</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>on every successful referral. Whether a customer uses your unique tracking link or your personalized coupon code at checkout, the sale is automatically attributed to you. With our high average order value, your 8% adds up quickly.</p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We encourage authentic storytelling. You can promote Lulu-Belle by:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p><strong>Lifestyle Imagery:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Sharing how our products fit into your daily aesthetic on Instagram or Pinterest.</p></li><li><p><strong>Unboxing &amp; Reviews:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Creating \"Get Ready With Me\" or \"Haul\" videos on TikTok and YouTube.</p></li><li><p><strong>Blog Features:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Writing about your favorite picks or styling tips.</p></li><li><p><strong>Direct Sharing:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Sending your personal discount code to friends, family, and followers.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></h3><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p><strong>Cookie Duration:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>30 days (you get credit for any purchase made within a month of the click).</p></li><li><p><strong>Payouts:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Reliable and transparent payments via your preferred method in UpPromote.</p></li><li><p><strong>Support:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>High-resolution brand assets and product images are available in your affiliate dashboard to help you create beautiful content.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
